        "content": [
          "For SSP, the process begins by receiving the invoice.",
          "it is sorted per client.",
          "it is then sorted per vendor.",
          "attach the invoice entry form to the invoice.",
          "the required information is entered onto the form.",
          "the completeness of the invoice is checked.",
          "If it is complete, the information for the SLA is entered. The date for completion is also entered and the priority is checked.",
          "If the priority is high, a red stamp is placed on the entry invoice.",
          "The invoice compliance is then checked.",
          "If the invoice needs to be sent to experienced staff... If it is a normal case... If none of these conditions apply...",
          "the non-compliance invoice is processed.",
          "The invoice is then batched and allocated to DEO",
          "and the process ends."
        ]
      },
